Preschoolers think like artists. They relate to an invisible God they can imagine. The One who designed the animals and created the flowers, the One who made them, and knows everything about them, who keeps them safe, and who loves them. Our goal in Small Wonders is to ignite their imagination, activate their senses, and structure their experience so they have a safe and embracing place to explore God’s truth and grow.
